sha256":"0f03e2420854358389440ca9e00768c8d7096b84922b091a96dc42b656ddcc0d"}],"primary_msid":"Away.Crossing","rationale":"The Human Rulings settle parent-branch status and unique species forking. The governing architecture assigns exact procedural ownership to the dedicated Crossing specification, while MSID Grammar preserves the canonical species roots and expressly prohibits unadjudicated flattening.","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T14:54:06.911155+00:00","recorded_by":"OpenAI:gpt-5.6-sol","related_unit_ids":["reconciliation_3cb4ae3b26cefe0589ca0b85","reconciliation_e2c0c31873e98a5235bcd97e"],"schema_version":"M050-RECONCILED-SEMANTIC-UNIT-0.1","unit_id":"reconciliation_6a7a38c29aadeb63ff839b6b","unit_status":"reconciled"}
{"authority_basis_atom_keys":["M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0001","M050-SRC-PA-001::ATOM-PA-DIRECT-0292","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0004-B00131-a2","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0008-B00248-2"],"canonical_claim":"Crossing concentrates complexity in observation and planning, followed by commitment to one whole-party passage and a brief continuous execution with compact resolution. The party resolves globally, while particular bodily consequences attach to particular Citizens. Commitment ends strategic replanning, although execution may permit immediate spatial responses such as advancing, holding, retreating while possible, protecting another Citizen, releasing cargo, or recovering from separation. Crossing is neither ordinary travel nor turn-based MEET, uses no tactical action-game structure, and may open MEET after severe disruption without itself acquiring turn structure.","decision_origin":"provider_reviewed","evidence":{"packet_sha256":"45a5f84becb658d0d77b3588d4bb3c0d76a7b39486a9a063c8530c236ec4fcdc","proposal_response_sha256":"8d7b650f490eee44bb0e8dbec72e26c5d2aebb2806ac63f665208976f6f484d7","review_response_sha256":"6b8f4a644ad5247e7d62b8d29e1f37270572050f5a994f2531bb65da3f7d4f98"},"members":[{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AUTHORIAL-GRAMMAR-001::P-B00450-1","disposition":"supporting","effective_claim_sha256":"85cc9be918d8483c464fc734761d10eb9a7b5330c2066e2c4f5c12738cbfcfbf"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-PA-001::ATOM-PA-DIRECT-0292","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"00018abc2b48e6062f13c6475b0bbbae6ad9056ebc0aa31cb5390b540ff5aa44"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0004-B00131-a1","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"4ca37293fe4465b14fddc516802331736a0827cfb8aea0a674926a2dddcec8b3"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0004-B00131-a2","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"8b0d783d2ccc77d192e9efea7f28752e2426c79517fb8de103ec89b04f2b19b5"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0004-B00131-a3","disposition":"supporting","eff