e776529922764f91017e4664328b39d0425ecd75c96d"}],"primary_msid":"Away.Crossing","rationale":"The sources agree on a one-plan, continuous-run contour, whole-party resolution with Citizen-specific adversity, and rejection of turn-based or tactical structures. Immediate execution decisions do not reopen strategic planning, and severe disruption may transition to MEET without changing Crossing's grammar.","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T14:54:06.911155+00:00","recorded_by":"OpenAI:gpt-5.6-sol","related_unit_ids":["reconciliation_6a7a38c29aadeb63ff839b6b","reconciliation_55f7408b364c359bee66e864","reconciliation_acd654e01348dada06633b70"],"schema_version":"M050-RECONCILED-SEMANTIC-UNIT-0.1","unit_id":"reconciliation_3cb4ae3b26cefe0589ca0b85","unit_status":"reconciled"}
{"authority_basis_atom_keys":["M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0005-M050-SRC-AWAY-001__B00150_dbf494cfc748-1","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0008-B00236-1"],"canonical_claim":"Before commitment, Crossing uses a deliberately limited Staging view. The player considers party, load, traffic, and the chosen edge or site; may redistribute one burdensome cargo item or protective Supply; sets the party's Crossing posture and immediate constraints; and then commits. Staging is not a tactical planning minigame.","decision_origin":"provider_reviewed","evidence":{"packet_sha256":"45a5f84becb658d0d77b3588d4bb3c0d76a7b39486a9a063c8530c236ec4fcdc","proposal_response_sha256":"8d7b650f490eee44bb0e8dbec72e26c5d2aebb2806ac63f665208976f6f484d7","review_response_sha256":"6b8f4a644ad5247e7d62b8d29e1f37270572050f5a994f2531bb65da3f7d4f98"},"members":[{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0005-M050-SRC-AWAY-001__B00150_dbf494cfc748-1","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"ae5abe13bff98faeec6a6e8ae7dc14c6bae9d542668e59c8a07d322b97b0633f"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0005-M050-SRC-AWAY-001__B00150_dbf494cfc748-2","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"b55322d53141deb4805f7a8936e244a5c29b978b66cd5c94e91a87797f09843c"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0007-B00227-1","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"dd3a0bd6518b29fd77f6e9bf6c2a961678363876a274b579a045e4733913388b"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0008-B00230-1","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"c2114c4ccff8928f0e817172ab6c3728c710c54faeecadc13fdcb348818646e5"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0008-B00236-1","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"47cc0b3c7b34a30449fdc468296e59bd85487392819389f0426618d2585d4727"}],"primary_msid":"Away.Crossing","rationale":"These compatible claims define Staging's scope, inputs, permitted adjustments, and terminating commitment while preserving its deliberately narrow decision space.","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T14:54:06.911155+00:00","recorded_by":"OpenAI:gpt-5.6-sol","related_unit_ids":["reconciliation_3cb4ae3b26cefe0589ca0b85"],"schema_version":"M050-RECONCILED-SEMANTIC-UNIT-0.1","unit_id":"reconciliation_55f7408b364c359bee66e864","unit_status":"reconciled"}
