{"authority_basis_atom_keys":["M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00271-1","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00274-1","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00275-1","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00275-2"],"canonical_claim":"Crossing's consequence ladder includes cargo loss, persistent Shaken or Fear Memory, acute Tharn, and rare death. Cargo loss abandons, scatters, or crushes a carried object, food bundle, or Supply. Fear is a named Condition that can affect later volunteering, Crossing posture, or MEET options. Tharn is an acute shutdown that interrupts the sequence and makes rescue or abandonment the only immediate question. Death is rare, explicit, and visible; it can never be generated by an opaque automatic roll or unattended off-screen state. Visible catastrophe remains visible during Crossing.","decision_origin":"provider_reviewed","evidence":{"packet_sha256":"45a5f84becb658d0d77b3588d4bb3c0d76a7b39486a9a063c8530c236ec4fcdc","proposal_response_sha256":"8d7b650f490eee44bb0e8dbec72e26c5d2aebb2806ac63f665208976f6f484d7","review_response_sha256":"6b8f4a644ad5247e7d62b8d29e1f37270572050f5a994f2531bb65da3f7d4f98"},"members":[{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00271-1","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"5a1ae1d4bfda3112a5a3d68050666c96ea0828051c8d13687f9d51f231dd8c98"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00272-1","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"7ffae05c658ea782f89531536b9fc5737ff0e1042e7f354750b6d6dc91f65f5d"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00274-1","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"3be95fca2cabae37bc234340d49d80ebb4b1205b6f62f434c67d77abbe536eb9"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00274-2","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"4ce0c414772a5b143826f01bb71b8b970f0c421c47bb941dc6a7f8d780f2a56f"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00275-1","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"f96e731a7581b6a28e1534abb75d7c207602a740882ea2f94e9b831141a024d8"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0101","disposition":"supporting","effective_claim_sha256":"d331665657ca8d998b1380501f48053a30ef6662b20ea2998a4ab8c403ac4b40"}],"primary_msid":"Away.Crossing","rationale":"The consequence ladder distinguishes persistent fear from acute Tharn and defines each outcome. Its death rule bars opaque automatic or unattended off-screen generation, while the Crossing specification preserves catastrophe's visibility.","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T14:54:06.911155+00:00","recorded_by":"OpenAI:gpt-5.6-sol","related_unit_ids":["reconciliation_acd654e01348dada06633b70"],"schema_version":"M050-RECONCILED-SEMANTIC-UNIT-0.1","unit_id":"reconciliation_2974e0131755ab2f690842cd","unit_status":"reconciled"}
{"authority_basis_atom_keys":["M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0002-B00049-2","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0010-B00295-2","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0010-B00302-2","M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0025-B00760-2"],"canonical_claim":"The fixed 70/20/10 return-Crossing roll is retired and replaced by burden-based return logic. Every returning party reaches the far-side Staging Post, where Return Burden is evaluated from time of day, traffic, route familiarity, load, injury, fear, party cohesion, and weather. Low burden receives a cinematic or abbreviated sequence that does not pretend Crossing never occurred; moderate burden receives a compressed Crossing with fewer windows and one decisive intervention so the day's cost remains legible; high burden requires a full manual Crossing in which a laden, hurt, late, or frightened party must earn the final passage.","decision_origin":"provider_reviewed","evidence":{"packet_sha256":"45a5f84becb658d0d77b3588d4bb3c0d76a7b39486a9a063c8530c236ec4fcdc","proposal_response_sha256":"8d7b650f490eee44bb0e8dbec72e26c5d2aebb2806ac63f665208976f6f484d7","review_response_sha256":"6b8f4a644ad5247e7d62b8d29e1f37270572050f5a994f2531bb65da3f7d4f98"},"members":[{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0002-B00049-1","disposition":"superseded","effective_claim_sha256":"9b2afaf2622a479fceaed27acbe20793a50710604097441544df848f61885272"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0002-B00049-2","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"98d22ffddffd02aab15af5088bbf86f81db18370f521abdc230f80d818177715"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0002-B00049-3","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"9d18705fda1fbfa09779dc446945179efe2c23e901b887932e7d31d856c92e21"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0005-M050-SRC-AWAY-001__B00156_e45e981a70e2-1","disposition":"supporting","effective_claim_sha256":"3119cd6daea05433ee44325cf59c765820ed165ac18207c3b230884287af6556"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0005-M050-SRC-AWAY-001__B00156_e45e981a70e2-2","disposition"