n scale. The high-burden rule carries stronger normative force than mere legibility: the burdened party must earn final passage through full manual Crossing.","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T14:54:06.911155+00:00","recorded_by":"OpenAI:gpt-5.6-sol","related_unit_ids":["reconciliation_3cb4ae3b26cefe0589ca0b85"],"schema_version":"M050-RECONCILED-SEMANTIC-UNIT-0.1","unit_id":"reconciliation_224c518e7eb019ea9b6805e9","unit_status":"reconciled"}
{"authority_basis_atom_keys":["M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0081","M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0085"],"canonical_claim":"Crow is an exception to the ground-party Crossing grammar: it auto-crosses in parallel under a distinct hidden avian adjudication affected by River Spume and roadway turbulence. Its result is independent of the ground party and is limited to Clean Flight, which has no consequence; Buffeted, which applies an existing Exposure-equivalent personal consequence; Cargo Drop, which loses one eligible ordinary carried item but never an Artifact; or Injury, which applies an existing wound or injury state. Crow may provide the ground party a deliberately modest aerial-information or underlying-success benefit. Most other land-bound Guests follow the Core Species grammar.","decision_origin":"provider_reviewed","evidence":{"packet_sha256":"45a5f84becb658d0d77b3588d4bb3c0d76a7b39486a9a063c8530c236ec4fcdc","proposal_response_sha256":"8d7b650f490eee44bb0e8dbec72e26c5d2aebb2806ac63f665208976f6f484d7","review_response_sha256":"6b8f4a644ad5247e7d62b8d29e1f37270572050f5a994f2531bb65da3f7d4f98"},"members":[{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0081","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"c44ac0e582f88b27f37aa549271cecf6484ad9d98a2b2fdeddec3ea06ed43de7"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0082","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"ba7ae76cbc57e097d643db42e09a0892daa0fd7cf299bd5c23d61cd02bf71111"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0083","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"fd75ebfbd2c56581eb53a8f4e0294a0ea43cab4b6195e0ef0dde67e0807e8e20"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0084","disposition":"elaboration","effective_claim_sha256":"eff2d84b7d55edafcd37f1fd0378a47d982df3f3a2b78c795554717dc979a619"},{"atom_key":"M050-SRC-CROSSING-001::ATOM-CROSS-ACCEPTED-0085","disposition":"basis","effective_claim_sha256":"2535bff23bac